<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">Installation</h2>

<p class="mb-8 text-zinc-600">
  LiveToast ships one set of default classes that works with Tailwind CSS 3.4 and 4.x. The only version-specific step
  is telling Tailwind where to find those classes.
</p>

<div class="mb-12 space-y-4">
  <h3 id="dependency" class="scroll-mt-20 text-lg font-semibold">Add the dependency</h3>
  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md bg-zinc-950 p-4 text-sm text-zinc-100"><code>def deps do
  [
    &#123;:live_toast, "~&gt; 0.10.2"&#125;
  ]
end</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="mb-12 space-y-4">
  <h3 id="javascript" class="scroll-mt-20 text-lg font-semibold">Set up the LiveView hook</h3>
  <p>Add LiveToast to your assets and register its hook when creating the LiveSocket.</p>
  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md bg-zinc-950 p-4 text-sm text-zinc-100"><code>import &#123; createLiveToastHook &#125; from "live_toast"

let liveSocket = new LiveSocket("/live", Socket, &#123;
  hooks: &#123; LiveToast: createLiveToastHook() &#125;
&#125;)</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="mb-12 space-y-4">
  <h3 id="tailwind-4" class="scroll-mt-20 text-lg font-semibold">Tailwind CSS 4</h3>
  <p>
    Keep the existing Tailwind import and source declarations in <code class="rounded-sm bg-zinc-50 px-1 text-rose-600">assets/css/app.css</code>, then register LiveToast as an
    explicit source:
  </p>
  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md bg-zinc-950 p-4 text-sm text-zinc-100"><code>@source "../../deps/live_toast/lib";</code></pre>
  <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600">
    Source paths are relative to the stylesheet. An umbrella application's path will usually be <code class="rounded-sm bg-zinc-50 px-1 text-rose-600">../../../../deps/live_toast/lib</code>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12 space-y-4">
  <h3 id="tailwind-3" class="scroll-mt-20 text-lg font-semibold">Tailwind CSS 3</h3>
  <p>
    Add LiveToast to the <code class="rounded-sm bg-zinc-50 px-1 text-rose-600">content</code>
    paths in <code class="rounded-sm bg-zinc-50 px-1 text-rose-600">assets/tailwind.config.js</code>:
  </p>
  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md bg-zinc-950 p-4 text-sm text-zinc-100"><code>module.exports = &#123;
  content: [
    "./js/**/*.js",
    "../lib/your_app_web/**/*.*ex",
    "../deps/live_toast/lib/**/*.*ex"
  ]
&#125;</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="mb-12 space-y-4">
  <h3 id="render-toast-group" class="scroll-mt-20 text-lg font-semibold">
    Render the toast group
  </h3>
  <p>
    Replace the Phoenix <code class="rounded-sm bg-zinc-50 px-1 text-rose-600">flash_group</code>
    in your layout:
  </p>
  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md bg-zinc-950 p-4 text-sm text-zinc-100"><code>&lt;LiveToast.toast_group
  flash=&#123;@flash&#125;
  connected=&#123;assigns[:socket] != nil&#125;
  toasts_sync=&#123;assigns[:toasts_sync]&#125;
/&gt;</code></pre>
  <p>
    See the
    <.link
      class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-500"
      href="https://hexdocs.pm/live_toast/readme.html#installation"
    >
      complete installation guide
    </.link>
    for package-manager alternatives and additional configuration.
  </p>
</div>
